 Iteration 12 adds internal exact finite-prefix machinery for deterministic known exogenous paths: the marginal reduction, finite-prefix LP dual \(D_n(P)\), and fixed-envelope compactness criterion. Literature checks found no direct theorem for this delayed-fill characterization. Lagziel-Lehrer 2015 is relevant delayed-approachability background for future vector-deficit formulations; Bistritz et al. 2022 is relevant weighted-regret delayed-bandit background for horizon-weighted certificates; Xie-Zhu-Shishkin 2025 is adjacent pricing context. All three should be cited as background only.
